# game/script.rpy:384
translate spanish p1c2_923e80bb:

    # "By the time I reached the cramped offices of the {i}Sunday Abbot{/i}, I was fully out of breath."
    "Cuando llegué a la siempre abarrotada oficina del {i}Sunday Abbot{/i}, estaba completamente sin aliento."

